# Deep water behind the board. Tiles both ways.
#
# Almost featureless by design: a match-3 board is read by colour, and the one
# thing a background here must never do is offer the eye anywhere else to go.
# The flecks exist only so a 800x600 field of one colour does not look like a
# rendering failure.
name puzzle-bg
size 32 32
key a deep-0-bg
key b deep-1
key c deep-2
pixels
